title: '''will-file-better-later'' insert'
pid: 106d2191-168d-49ff-a80a-1766c017832a
body: |2-
  Put a 'subfolder' note called 'unsorted' at the (top) of a topic note.
  That way ideas relevant to the topic can be quickly pinned to the topic,
  without obscuring the view of better-understood principles already 'well-sorted'
  in the topic's contents, and yet without losing sight of the newcomers.
